"The goal is to prevent connections to the five hosts below. You can use domain-blocking rules or DNS overrides; neither a specific app nor DNS is required. This does not disable all location sources. Normal mode needs no network rules." = "目标是阻止连接下方五个主机。可使用域名拦截规则或 DNS 覆写，不限定工具，也不要求必须使用 DNS。这不会关闭全部定位来源，普通模式无需配置网络规则。";
