"This hosts-format example maps the domains to loopback addresses. Adapt it to your tool’s syntax; DNS overrides are optional if you use connection-blocking rules instead." = "以下 hosts 格式示例将域名映射到本机回环地址。请按工具要求调整语法；如果已使用连接拦截规则，则无需再配置 DNS 覆写。";
"This recovery sequence is a community workaround for repeated pairing failures." = "此方法来自社区经验，不保证适用于所有配对问题。";
"This resets Bluetooth preferences for your Mac user. Other Bluetooth accessories may need to be reconnected." = "这会重置当前 Mac 用户的蓝牙偏好设置。其他蓝牙配件可能需要重新连接。";
"Tools such as Surge, Loon, Stash, Quantumult X and Shadowrocket can apply domain rules. Add reject or block rules for these hostnames using your tool’s syntax, covering both Wi-Fi and cellular data. Routing traffic through a proxy alone does not block it." = "可使用 Surge、Loon、Stash、Quantumult X、Shadowrocket 等网络工具。按工具要求为这些主机名添加拒绝或拦截规则，并同时覆盖 Wi-Fi 和蜂窝数据。仅将流量转发到代理并不等于拦截连接。";
